/**
 * isiXhosa province editorial — a sentence-for-sentence translation of
 * `PROVINCE_EDITORIAL` in src/data/province-editorial.ts.
 *
 * A LOCALE VARIANT, never an edit: the English module is consumed by the English routes
 * and by the isiZulu routes, so translating a value in place there would silently corrupt
 * both. It reuses the English `ProvinceEditorial` interface, so a field added upstream
 * fails the build here rather than quietly rendering blank.
 *
 * The record KEYS are the English province names because they are the data join key —
 * `provinceSlug()`, the facility records, COVERAGE.xh and hreflang all run on them.
 * Province names, district names, facility names, department names, phone numbers and
 * every figure are carried across unchanged; inline `href` values stay canonical English
 * paths and are prefixed at render time by `localiseHtml` (src/i18n/links.ts).
 */
